 Affected route(s) (parameterized): mostly `/search`, also `/search/r/:reportID`\n- Mechanism: generic, level fatal, `app_blocking: true`\n\n## Stack trace (top frames, first-party only)\n\n```\nsrc/hooks/useSidebarOrderedReports.tsx:328   useEffect -> setCurrentReportsToDisplay(reportsToDisplayInLHN)\nreact-dom commitHookEffectListMount -> dispatchSetState -> getRootForUpdatedFiber\nError: Maximum update depth exceeded (React #185)\n```\n\n## Suspected cause\n\nThe effect at `useSidebarOrderedReports.tsx:328` copies `reportsToDisplayInLHN` into state each time the memo returns a new object. The memo at line 229 leaves `currentReportsToDisplay` out of its dependencies on purpose, to avoid a loop. So a loop here means that one of the memo's other dependencies gets a new identity on every render on `/search`.\n\n## Reproduction\n\nUnknown. See the Sentry events linked from the Sentry issue.\n\n## Related\n\n- Sibling Sentry IDs: none confirmed\n- Prior GH issues: none found\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022112637803657814041\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022112637803657814041</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2112637803657814041</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-11-03</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @parasharrajat</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/104504/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/104504/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/104951","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/104951/labels{/name}","comme